    that global becomes something you have to keep documented.

  [1mMy recommendation: the hostname-based switch[0m, because this repo has no deploy pipeline to hang a file swap on, and the
  override hook is machinery for a need that doesn't exist yet. It's also the cheapest of the three to upgrade later —
